L["The Overview is the whole auction house at a glance, like a stock exchange's indexes: is the market getting dearer or cheaper, how much is listed, and where the gold is. It's off by default: switch it on under Settings, General, and Overview appears next to Screener on the Market tab's toolbar. Market data takes a little longer to update while it's on."] = true
L["The auction house cuts and the listing length under Selling count everywhere money is worked out: deposits, VENDOR calls, posting prices and arbitrage."] = true
L["The average daily market price over the chosen period (Settings > Average period, 7 days by default). Compare it with today's market price to see if the item is cheap or expensive right now."] = true
