L["The bell left of the tabs is the notification center: it keeps the alerts that fired (and players asking to share prices with you), newest first, with a red count of the ones you haven't seen. Click one to open its item (or, for a request, Settings, Sharing); Clear all empties it."] = true
L["The button next to AME's title picks which auction house you're looking at: yours, the other faction's or the goblin AH. Each keeps its own history; scan there (any character on this account counts) to fill it."] = true
