L["The price chart: market price, lowest listing, two averages (MA 20 and the 7-day average) and supply. Switch to candles for a trading view. Mouse wheel zooms, drag pans, double-click resets. To chart an item, type its name in the search box above the chart (Enter opens the best match), Shift-click it anywhere (bags, chat, the AH) while the Item tab is showing, or pick a modifier click under Settings, Tooltips & charts that charts it from anywhere."] = true
L["The queue opens beside the profession window. Parts come first: queue gauntlets and the bars they need are smelted ahead of them - when making the bars is cheaper than buying them (Buy or Make on the line switches it). Each material shows its source in a fixed order: your bags, your bank, your other characters, a guild bank, a vendor, a step of the queue, and the auction house for the rest."] = true
